# HM07 Waterfall (FLAG_RECEIVED_HM_WATERFALL, milestone 40) taught to the Swampert in place of Muddy Water: Ever
# Grande City's waterfall up to the Pokemon League (walk_to surf: A + YES at the falls).
party-move 0 2 MOVE_WATERFALL
# Victory Road's trainers (double battles among them: VictoryRoad_1F/B1F scripts, lv 40-45) after Wally, with no
# Pokemon Center inside: the chained Swampert alone runs dry and the HM carriers (Castform lv27, Linoone lv30) fall
